Uses Binary Search to find the first bad version
If mid is bad → search left side (right = mid)
Else → search right side (left = mid + 1)
Stops when left == right → first bad version found

Complexity
Time: O(log n)
Space: O(1)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
public class Solution extends VersionControl {
    public int firstBadVersion(int n) {
        int left=1;
        int right=n;
        while(left<right){
            int mid=left+(right-left)/2;
            if(isBadVersion(mid)){
                right=mid;
            }else{
                left=mid+1;
            }
        }
        return right;
        
    }
}
